{
  "project": {
    "name": "Keyed / Spline Hub Adapter",
    "slug": "spline-hub",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine": "cadquery",
    "description": {
      "en": "A hub with an internal torque-transmitting bore that couples a printed part to a motor shaft, gearbox, or actuator. Three bore types: a keyway (round bore + rectangular key slot), an approximate involute spline (a toothed bore with N teeth sharing the load), and a hex bore for hex shafts. Optional outer mounting flange with a bolt-hole circle.\n\nOfficial Visualizer and Configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Un cubo con un barreno interno transmisor de par que acopla una pieza impresa a un eje de motor, caja reductora o actuador. Tres tipos de barreno: un chavetero (barreno redondo + ranura rectangular), un estriado de involuta aproximado (barreno dentado con N dientes que reparten la carga) y un barreno hexagonal para ejes hexagonales. Brida de montaje exterior opcional con círculo de pernos.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/spline-hub.webp",
    "difficulty": "advanced",
    "tags": [
      "spline",
      "keyway",
      "hub",
      "coupling",
      "shaft",
      "torque",
      "hex",
      "hyperobject",
      "commons"
    ],
    "hyperobject": {
      "is_hyperobject": true
    },
    "force_backend": true
  },
